              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake aatagorokine apa nanu Olaitoriani te nkaraki intae, neitu ninye aaning nanu; naajoki nanu Olaitoriani, ‘Tabaiki iyie ine; mikingil iyie airorie nanu tialo ena bae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilepa shomo enchumata e Pisga; nishumu inkonyek inono aing'or enkalo oloo ntoluo, naa ng'ura etii ina kop nkonyek inono, amu milo iyie alang ele keju le Yordan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ntanapa Yoshua, nintagol ninye oshoke nintipij ninye, amu kelang ninye aimu te dukuya kulo tung'ana, naa kelo ninye aitujung ninche ina nilo iyie adol.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
